Package: FairTargeting
Title: Fair and Pareto-Optimal Policy Targeting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Davide", "Viviano", role = "aut"),
    person("Jelena", "Bradic", role = "aut"),
    person("Sasha", "Stasovskyi", email = "ostasovskyi@college.harvard.edu", role = c("cre", "ctb"))
  )
Description: Implements Fair Policy Targeting estimators for treatment allocation
    rules. The package estimates nuisance functions, constructs doubly robust
    welfare scores, approximates the Pareto frontier, and solves the fair policy
    optimization problem with Gurobi, following Viviano and Bradic (2022)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2005.12395>.
